# Netlify DNS (muaaz-vorajee)

DNS for **muaazvorajee.com** is on **Netlify DNS**. Site config: `.cursor/netlify-dns.json`.

Before changing records, load the **netlify-dns** skill (`~/.cursor/skills/netlify-dns/SKILL.md`) and use:

```bash
node ~/.cursor/skills/netlify-dns/scripts/netlify-dns.mjs list
```

Auth: `npx netlify login` (already used for deploys) or `NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN`.

Do not remove managed NETLIFY apex/www records without explicit user approval.
